    "en": "[Shortly thereafter, at a nearby bakery] ::CRASH:: ::RUMBLE:: ::VRRRRRR:: '... I don't know, officer.  It just scooped up an entire rack of scones and drove away!'",
    "noteEn": "The Spanish archive and official xkcd source both identify comic #677. The English title text is copied verbatim from official xkcd; its two spaces after officer. are intentional. The raster joins the printed line-break fragments MIEN-/TRAS and POR-/QUE as MIENTRAS and PORQUE, treats RUNRUN as lexical Spanish onomatopoeia, inventories 4X4 as a nonlexical alphanumeric vehicle label, and inventories the silent ellipsis and final musical-note glyphs as nonlexical symbols."
