      "noteEn": "Creyéndose comes from the pronominal verb creerse. Creyendo is creer in its -iendo action form, and se is attached for the person being described. A description normally follows.",
      "example": {
        "es": "Luis salió creyéndose invencible.",
        "en": "Luis left thinking himself invincible."
