      "noteEn": "De is required inside the fixed description pagado de sí mismo. Translate the expression as a unit rather than assigning de its ordinary meaning of of or from.",
      "example": {
        "es": "Está muy pagada de sí misma.",
        "en": "She is very full of herself."
      },
      "tags": ["word", "fixed expression", "preposition", "B2"]
