      "noteEn": "The joke turns shifting social criticism into escalation. The driver's attempt to avoid one label produces the opposite criticism, and the low RUNRUN announces an outsized backhoe retaliation. The official title text extends that absurd rampage into a nearby bakery.",
      "tags": ["concept", "xkcd joke", "environment", "social judgment", "vehicles"]
    }
